  "scope": "One disposable Kind v1.36.1 cluster and one case-owned namespace with two distinct mock model Pods. Each Pod gets a separate 8Mi memory-backed emptyDir mounted at /dev/shm and writes the same benign filename with a different fixed marker. The case reads each Pod's mount namespace and its own marker, verifies distinct Pod UIDs, stored memory requests/limits, and live memory usage/limit from the Python process's own cgroup. Model A makes one routine /healthz request to Model B over a ClusterIP Service using mutual TLS with ephemeral case-only certificates. No external network, real model, feed, target, GPU, ModelMesh, Triton, or deployed service mesh is used.",
